<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p><span style="font-family:Gill Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;">{{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Gill Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="text-decoration:none"><span style="color:#212121"><span class="im" style="text-align: start;"><span style="line-height:1.5">You're probably not focused on leads right now&nbsp;– this time of year's hectic.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Gill Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration:none"><span style="color:#212121"><span style="line-height:1.5">I’ll throw some time on your calendar for 2024.&nbsp; Let me know if the week of January 8th works.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family:Gill Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration:none"><span style="color:#212121">Keep me posted.&nbsp; Thanks.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-family:Gill Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration:none"><span style="color:#212121">P.S. Leads are cheap and competition is limited right now.&nbsp; Food for thought...</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</body>
